  "title": {
   "en": "Level 1 kara Hajimaru Shoukan Musou - Ore Dake Tsukaeru Ura Dungeon de Subete no Tenseisha o Bucchigiru (Webtoon)"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "レベル1から始まる召喚無双 俺だけ使える裏ダンジョンですべての転生者をぶっちぎる"
   },
   {
    "en": "Starting from Level 1: I’ll Defeat All Reincarnated Monsters in My Secret Dungeon"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Invincible Summoner Who Crawled up From Level 1: I'll Beat All the Reincarnators in the Secret Dungeon That Only I Can Use! (Webtoon)"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Shinobu Ijima, a young man who died with his sister in a sudden explosion, is reincarnated into the world of Lavita Online, a game he played as a hobby. The only problem is, he’s back at level 1…\nWhen Shinobu finds out that his sister will also be reincarnated into his world, he begins a hellish training regime to gain the power to compete against max-level players.\nThe WEBTOON version of the hugely popular original novel is finally here!!",
   "ja": "謎の災害で命を失い、自分のやっていたゲーム世界に転生されられた飯島忍。転生カンストプレイヤーの存在、転生したクズの義父、義父に体を狙われた妹、自分だけレベル１での転生――。逆境から這い上がり廃課金者たちを出し抜け!!"
  },
